<title>USA: CapStar Hotel names John Emery as CFO.</title>
<headline>CapStar Hotel names John Emery as CFO.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>CapStar Hotel Co said on Tuesday that it has named John Emery as chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Emery, who has served as the company's treasurer and secretary, replaces William Karnes, the company said.</p>
<p>Karnes will continue to play an integral role with CapStar, based in his hometown of Chicago, CapStar said.</p>
